\] Since the denominators \(\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{v}\) are equal, we can equate the numerators: \[
\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{v} = \mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{v}
\] This gives us the equation: \[
